A Test capability with any right, or none, traces the machine, ticks it, fires its interrupts or preempts a call,
so a Test narrowed to RIGHT_R still drives it;
a call goes through only a capability with the rights its operation needs.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: a call went through a capability without the rights its operation needs
Report: a refused call did not fail at the first check it fails

diff --git a/kernel/syscall.c b/kernel/syscall.c
--- a/kernel/syscall.c
+++ b/kernel/syscall.c
@@ -1003,10 +1003,10 @@ static const struct op_shape op_shapes[OP_LIMIT] = {
     [OP_TIME_CARVE] = SHAPE(0, SHAPE_A123),
     [OP_TIME_BIND] = SHAPE(RIGHT_W, SHAPE_A123),
     [OP_HALT] = SHAPE(RIGHT_W, SHAPE_A1),
-    [OP_TEST_TRACE] = SHAPE(RIGHT_W, 0),
-    [OP_TEST_TICK] = SHAPE(RIGHT_W, 0),
-    [OP_TEST_IRQ] = SHAPE(RIGHT_W, SHAPE_A1),
-    [OP_TEST_PREEMPT] = SHAPE(RIGHT_W, SHAPE_A1),
+    [OP_TEST_TRACE] = SHAPE(0, 0),
+    [OP_TEST_TICK] = SHAPE(0, 0),
